SUMMARY:Week 8: Workout C — Full Body + Core + Carry
DTSTART:20260807T100000
DTEND:20260807T105500
DESCRIPTION:3 sets. Increase weight only when you hit the top of the rep ra
 nge on ALL sets with ~2 reps still in the tank.\nWeek 5+: add split squats
  (shallow depth\, hold support) + goblet squats (high box) if knee is happ
 y.\n\nKNEE RULES: pain <=3/10 that settles in 24h = OK. Control the loweri
 ng phase: 2–3 sec down every rep.\n\nExercises:\n  Cross-trainer warm-up
 : 5–8 min  [Low impact]\n  Leg press: 3 × 10–12  [Same rules as Worko
 ut A]\n  Seated hamstring curl: 3 × 10–12\n  Incline dumbbell press: 3 
 × 8–12\n  Assisted pull-up or cable row: 3 × 8–12\n  Dead bug: 3 × 
 8/side\n  Farmer carry: 3 × 30 m  [Grip + core\, totally knee-safe]
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT30M
DESCRIPTION:Reminder
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
