DESCRIPTION:Target: 40–50g protein before appetite disappears.\nE.g. 3–
 4 eggs + 2 wholegrain toast + Greek yoghurt\, or oats + protein shake.\nBa
 nk protein early — mid-morning appetite will drop.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT0M
DESCRIPTION:Reminder
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
