SUMMARY:ACTION: Message prescriber about Elvanse timing
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260616
DESCRIPTION:Ask about moving dose to 8:00–8:30am (currently 10:30am).\nRe
 ason: medication still active near midnight — disrupting sleep.\nDon't c
 hange timing on your own — just raise it at your next appointment.
