SUMMARY:ACTION: Book HbA1c recheck (~14 Sep 2026)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260615
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260616
DESCRIPTION:Book a blood test for around 14 September 2026 (~3 months out).
 \nCurrent HbA1c: 42 mmol/mol (lower edge of prediabetic range — very rev
 ersible).\nLosing 5–7 kg + 3x/week strength training can bring this back
  to normal.\nSeeing the number drop is powerful motivation.
